### Variaveis compartilhadas por todos os arquivos desta pasta.
### Rode as requisicoes desta pagina primeiro: elas produzem o token e o tenant.
@api = http://localhost:8000
@anonKey = {{$dotenv ANON_KEY}}
@serviceKey = {{$dotenv SERVICE_ROLE_KEY}}
@email = alice@acme.test
@password = Password123!

### Cadastro (o GoTrue local confirma o e-mail sozinho)
POST {{api}}/auth/v1/signup
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login — guarde o access_token da resposta em @token
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
apikey: {{anonKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Meus tenants — guarde o id em @tenant
# @name meusTenants
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@tenant = {{meusTenants.response.body.data.0.id}}

### Saude de cada modulo (nao exige autenticacao)
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/tenancy/health

###
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/crm/health

### Lista de rotas de um modulo
GET {{api}}/functions/v1/crm/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
x-tenant-id: {{tenant}}
